WEBVTT

00:20.200 --> 00:20.840
During the day

00:21.000 --> 00:23.360
I saw these two standing on Yiyang's city walls

00:23.440 --> 00:24.840
They're not enemies

00:25.280 --> 00:26.400
You two

00:26.480 --> 00:28.480
Why are you dressed like this?

00:31.400 --> 00:32.000
Confidential

00:32.160 --> 00:33.360
I understand

00:33.440 --> 00:34.160
I am the commander

00:34.240 --> 00:35.400
Liu Dadao's granddaughter

00:35.480 --> 00:36.720
I'm Liu Nian

00:36.800 --> 00:37.920
This is Uncle Qiu

00:38.000 --> 00:39.400
Grandfather's capable deputy

00:41.760 --> 00:43.760
Yiyang garrison deputy general Xie Xuan

00:44.120 --> 00:45.480
By my general's orders

00:45.560 --> 00:47.040
Come to discuss with General Liu

00:47.120 --> 00:48.040
The matter of volunteers entering in groups

00:48.120 --> 00:49.520
Specific details

00:50.640 --> 00:51.440
Follow me

00:51.520 --> 00:53.520
I'll take you to see grandfather

01:04.320 --> 01:04.840
Those two

01:05.000 --> 01:06.080
One of them said

01:06.160 --> 01:07.960
He's the Yiyang garrison deputy general

01:08.040 --> 01:09.160
The other didn't mention

01:09.240 --> 01:10.880
But I think something's off

01:10.960 --> 01:12.080
What's off?

01:12.160 --> 01:13.880
Didn't I treat everyone's

01:13.960 --> 01:15.400
Frostbite on hands and feet?

01:15.560 --> 01:16.440
His hands

01:16.520 --> 01:17.920
Look different from ours

01:18.600 --> 01:19.640
What?

01:19.720 --> 01:21.200
He has six fingers

01:34.640 --> 01:37.307
Your general pays respects to Prince of Jin

01:37.840 --> 01:39.240
Grandfather

01:43.520 --> 01:44.360
Pay

01:44.440 --> 01:45.760
Respects to Your Highness

01:45.840 --> 01:47.240
Commander Liu

01:47.400 --> 01:48.880
Why would I need to hide

01:48.960 --> 01:50.360
To come out and see you?

01:50.440 --> 01:51.560
Do you understand

01:51.640 --> 01:52.560
This

01:52.640 --> 01:53.640
This

01:53.720 --> 01:54.520
In the volunteer army

01:54.640 --> 01:56.000
There are many eyes

01:56.080 --> 01:58.080
A force of nearly ten thousand

01:58.440 --> 01:59.000
Can you guarantee

01:59.080 --> 02:00.760
You know each person's background?

02:01.960 --> 02:02.920
In this volunteer army

02:03.040 --> 02:04.600
There's more than just my group

02:04.760 --> 02:06.427
Everyone just came together temporarily

02:06.640 --> 02:07.200
So

02:07.280 --> 02:09.613
I cannot let you into the city

02:11.560 --> 02:12.840
If in the volunteer army

02:12.920 --> 02:14.040
There are Wuzhao spies

02:14.120 --> 02:15.360
Taking advantage of the chaos

02:17.080 --> 02:18.360
The northern expedition fails

02:18.440 --> 02:19.840
Liu Dadao

02:20.400 --> 02:21.600
You who came from afar

02:21.680 --> 02:22.720
Noble volunteers

02:22.800 --> 02:24.467
Will all become eternal sinners

02:25.520 --> 02:26.120
Your Highness

02:26.240 --> 02:27.640
This

02:31.040 --> 02:32.707
I naturally trust Commander Liu

02:32.960 --> 02:34.320
But I'm also afraid Commander Liu

02:34.400 --> 02:35.800
Will misunderstand my intentions

02:36.120 --> 02:37.200
That's why I specifically risked

02:37.280 --> 02:38.040
Hiding my identity

02:38.200 --> 02:39.867
To explain to Commander Liu

02:40.160 --> 02:41.800
And discuss a solution

02:46.280 --> 02:47.680
Rise

03:20.600 --> 03:21.720
Your Highness's concerns

03:21.800 --> 03:23.200
I understand

03:23.760 --> 03:24.960
But Your Highness says

03:25.040 --> 03:27.373
There may be spies among my brothers

03:27.680 --> 03:29.120
What's the evidence?
